    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your merciless opponent manages to grab hold of your ears (or hair, or hat) and yanks your face down do connect with his ascending knee. The ensuing crunch is the sound of several teeth and your jaw shattering.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass an Average (+20) Endurance Test or go @Condition[Unconscious], otherwise gaining @Condition[Stunned] (3). You suffer a Broken Bone (Major) and lose 1d10+5 teeth (see under Amputated Parts).</p>"
    },
